(62, 9, '9. Which option connects the following ideas smoothly? “It was raining heavily. The football match was cancelled. The players were unhappy.”', '[\"a. The football match was cancelled, so it was raining heavily. Therefore, the players were unhappy.\",\"b. The football match was cancelled because it was raining heavily. Therefore, the players were unhappy.\",\"c. Because the football match was cancelled, the players were unhappy. So, it was raining heavily.\",\"d. The players were unhappy because the football match was cancelled. Because, it was raining heavily.\"]', '[\"1\"]', 1, NULL, NULL),
