(48, 24, 59, 2, 56, 'writing', '```json\n{\n    \"score\": 3,\n    \"explanation\": [\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Grammar & Sentence Structure\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The essay contains significant grammar and sentence structure errors, such as \'I won 20 price\' instead of \'I won 20 prizes\' and \'It was so memorable for my life.\' instead of \'It was a memorable event in my life.\'\",\n            \"Score\": \"3/10\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Vocabulary\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The vocabulary used in the essay is very simple, and there are some incorrect word choices, such as \'price\' instead of \'prizes.\' The description lacks vivid or varied vocabulary.\",\n            \"Score\": \"3/10\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Coherence & Cohesion\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The essay lacks coherence and cohesion. It is very short and does not provide a clear or detailed narrative of the event. There are minimal linkages or transitions between ideas.\",\n            \"Score\": \"2/10\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Topic Relevance\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The essay is minimally relevant to the topic. It mentions winning prizes at a school program, but it does not effectively describe the event or explain why it brings a smile.\",\n            \"Score\": \"3/10\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```', '\"My school annual program. I won 20 price in this program. It was so memorable for my life.\"', 'yes', 3, '2025-04-23 01:03:15', '2025-04-23 01:03:15'),
(49, 25, 60, 3, 57, 'writing', '```json\n{\n    \"score\": 6.5,\n    \"explanation\": [\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Grammar & Sentence Structure\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The essay is well-written with clear sentence structure and few grammatical errors. It maintains a professional tone and the sentences are varied in structure, enhancing readability.\",\n            \"Score\": \"8/10\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Vocabulary\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The vocabulary used is appropriate and precise, but it lacks variety. There could be more use of advanced vocabulary to enhance the essay’s sophistication.\",\n            \"Score\": \"7/10\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Coherence & Cohesion\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The essay is cohesive and ideas flow logically from one to another. However, there could be smoother transitions between certain arguments to join points more coherently.\",\n            \"Score\": \"6/10\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"Criteria\": \"Topic Relevance\",\n            \"Comments\": \"The essay covers the main advantages and disadvantages of online shopping as required by the topic prompt, but it touches on some aspects more briefly than others. A more balanced exploration would improve the relevance score.\",\n            \"Score\": \"5/10\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```', '\"Online shopping offers unprecedented convenience, allowing consumers to browse endless products from home without time constraints. It enables easy price comparison and often features exclusive deals unavailable in physical stores. However, the inability to physically examine products before purchasing can lead to disappointment. Delivery delays, shipping costs, and potential security risks with personal information present additional drawbacks. The environmental impact of excessive packaging and transportation emissions also raises concerns. Many shoppers now blend online and in-store experiences to maximize benefits\"', 'yes', 7, '2025-04-23 01:03:57', '2025-04-23 01:03:57');
